sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User / Coordinator
    participant LoginPage as 📱 Login Page (Login.jsx)
    participant AppContext as ⚛️ AppContext / State
    participant AxiosService as 🌐 Axios API Client (api.js)
    participant AuthController as ☕ UserController / AuthController
    participant UserService as ⚙️ UserServiceImpl
    participant UserRepo as 🗄️ UserRepository
    participant Database as 🐬 MySQL Database
    participant LocalStorage as 💾 Browser localStorage

    User->>LoginPage: 1. Inputs Email & Password and Clicks "Sign In"
    LoginPage->>AppContext: 2. Calls login(email, password)
    AppContext->>AxiosService: 3. Calls authService.login(credentials)
    AxiosService->>AuthController: 4. POST /api/auth/login (HTTP Payload)
    AuthController->>UserService: 5. validateUser(email, password)
    UserService->>UserRepo: 6. findByEmail(email)
    UserRepo->>Database: 7. SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    Database-->>UserRepo: 8. Returns User Record (Hashed Password, Role)
    UserRepo-->>UserService: 9. User Entity

    alt Invalid Credentials
        UserService-->>AuthController: 10a. Invalid Credentials Exception
        AuthController-->>AxiosService: 11a. HTTP 401 Unauthorized Response
        AxiosService-->>AppContext: 12a. Interceptor catches Error
        AppContext->>LoginPage: 13a. Trigger showToast("Invalid credentials", "error")
        LoginPage-->>User: 14a. Display Error Alert Message
    else Successful Authentication
        UserService->>UserService: 10b. Verify Password & Generate JWT Token
        UserService-->>AuthController: 11b. AuthResponse (JWT Token + User DTO)
        AuthController-->>AxiosService: 12b. HTTP 200 OK (JWT Token Payload)
        AxiosService-->>AppContext: 13b. Return User Data & JWT Token
        AppContext->>LocalStorage: 14b. setItem('token', 'mock-jwt-token') & setItem('user', JSON)
        AppContext->>LoginPage: 15b. Update State (isAuthenticated=true, user)
        LoginPage->>User: 16b. Show Toast ("Welcome back") & Redirect to /dashboard
    end

    opt Subsequent Protected API Request (e.g. Fetch Disasters)
        User->>LoginPage: 17. Access Protected Page (/dashboard)
        LoginPage->>AxiosService: 18. Calls disasterService.getAll()
        AxiosService->>LocalStorage: 19. getItem('token')
        LocalStorage-->>AxiosService: 20. Returns 'Bearer <jwt-token>'
        AxiosService->>AuthController: 21. GET /api/disasters (Header: Authorization: Bearer <token>)
        AuthController->>AuthController: 22. SecurityConfig / JWT Filter validates Token & Grant Access
        AuthController-->>AxiosService: 23. HTTP 200 OK (Disaster Data)
        AxiosService-->>LoginPage: 24. Render Data on UI
    end
